<title>POLAND: DEBICA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>DEBICA OCT NET FALLS TO PLN 3.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.53 vs   4.51</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.78 vs   5.75</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.60 vs   6.49</p>
<p> Sales		   55.17 vs  45.36</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	    34.73 vs  39.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	61.86 vs  56.66</p>
<p> Operating profit    43.10 vs  64.38</p>
<p> Sales		  507.62 vs 412.52</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish tyre maker is TC Debica SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
